    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59635" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾱνίον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>upper part of the head, skull</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλῆς τὸ τριχωτὸν μέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					491a31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.739
			</span></i>); of horses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅθι τε πρῶται τρίχες ἵππων κρανίῳ
					ἐμπεφύασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.84
				</span></i>
			; of men, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				683
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				299e
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <i>head</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Amphis
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>headache,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hippiatr.
				103
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακράνιον</span>
			).</div>
